      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;industrial-manufacturing--advanced-equipment&#34; class=&#34;heading &#34;&gt;Industrial Manufacturing &amp;amp; Advanced Equipment&lt;a href=&#34;#industrial-manufacturing--advanced-equipment&#34; aria-labelledby=&#34;industrial-manufacturing--advanced-equipment&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;!-- &lt;i class=&#34;fas fa-link anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; --&gt;&#xA;        &lt;svg class=&#34;svg-inline--fa fas fa-link anchor&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; role=&#34;img&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 576 512&#34;&gt;&lt;use href=&#34;#fas-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&amp;nbsp;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We specialize in the international trade of industrial manufacturing equipment and systems:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-end Manufacturing Products&lt;/strong&gt;: Robots, automation equipment, and drones.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Services&lt;/strong&gt;: Industrial technology services, technical consulting, and cross-border project docking.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Integration&lt;/strong&gt;: Import/export agency and supply chain integration for industrial products and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
